    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are people that care but thats not the point. it's not like they can actually take the weight off my shoulders. it's just constant. i look at my mom and i see her getting worse, and then i look at myself and i just see someone who is running on empty. i feel like a ghost just going through the motions. it just feels like there's no end in sight, you know? like this is just how life is now.",
